"body-lg-regular text-text-base-primary wrap-break-word">Open enrollment is your time once a year to buy, renew or change your plan for the upcoming year.</p></div></div></div><div class="w-full min-w-0 shrink-0 overflow-hidden hidden lg:block rounded-2xl md:rounded-4xl"><img alt="" class="block h-auto w-full" decoding="async" height="760" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 90rem) calc((90rem - 2 * var(--spacing-16) - var(--spacing-8)) / 2), (min-width: 80rem) calc((100vw - 2 * var(--spacing-10) - var(--spacing-8)) / 2), calc((100vw - 2 * var(--spacing-10) - var(--spacing-8)) / 2)" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 640w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 750w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 828w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 1080w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 1200w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 1920w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=2400&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 2400w" width="1350"/></div><div class="min-w-0 shrink-0 overflow-hidden w-full md:hidden rounded-2xl md:rounded-4xl"><img alt="" class="block h-auto w-full" decoding="async" fetchPriority="high" height="760" loading="eager" sizes="(min-width: 48rem) calc(100vw - 2 * var(--spacing-10)), calc(100vw - 2 * var(--spacing-6))" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 640w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 750w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 828w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 1080w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 1200w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 1920w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=2400&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 2400w" width="1350"/></div><div class="min-w-0 shrink-0 overflow-hidden hidden w-full md:block lg:hidden rounded-2xl md:rounded-4xl"><img alt="" class="block h-auto w-full" decoding="async" height="760" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 48rem) calc(100vw - 2 * var(--spacing-10)), calc(100vw - 2 * var(--spacing-10))" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 640w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 750w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 828w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 1080w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 1200w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 1920w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/9b75c6036505a8b4a2fcccaa9abbee07dfb4cc67-1350x760.png?w=2400&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=90&amp;fit=max 2400w" width="1350"/></div></div></div></section></div><div data-block-key="8c3b992d8eea" class=""><div class="container py-10 lg:py-12"><div class="page-grid max-w-full min-w-0"><div class="col-span-4 min-w-0 md:col-span-10 md:col-start-2 lg:col-span-8 lg:col-start-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col [&amp;&gt;*+*]:mt-8 [&amp;&gt;h1+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h2+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h3+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h4+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h5+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h6+*]:mt-2.5"><h2 class="heading-lg-medium lg:display-sm-medium break-words text-text-base-primary [&amp;_strong]:font-[weight:inherit] [&amp;_b]:font-[weight:inherit]">What is open enrollment?</h2><p class="body-sm-regular lg:body-md-regular text-text-base-primary break-words">Open enrollment is when all eligible Californians can apply for a health or dental insurance plan through Covered California. It lasts from Nov. 1 to Jan. 31.</p><p class="body-sm-regular lg:body-md-regular text-text-base-primary break-words">During this time, you can enroll for the first time, switch plans or renew your plan for the coming year. When you apply, we’ll check your information and see what financial help you could get and what other programs you may be eligible for, including Medi-Cal.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-block-key="de01a8510807" class=""><div class="bg-bg-base-primary w-full rounded-t-4xl"><div class="container w-full px-4 py-8 md:p-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-12"><div class="bg-bg-base-tertiary rounded-t-4xl rounded-bl-4xl px-4 py-8 md:px-9"><ul class="flex flex-col" role="list"><li><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:gap-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-md-regular text-text-base-primary wrap-break-word">Open Enrollment Ends Jan. 31</h3><p class="body-md-regular text-text-base-primary wrap-break-word">Enroll by Dec. 31 for a health plan that starts Jan. 1. Enroll in January for a plan starting Feb. 1. 
</p></div><div class="w-full shrink-0 md:w-auto"><a data-slot="button" data-variant="secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="relative inline-flex items-center justify-center border-thin border-solid cursor-pointer disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-dashed focus-visible:outline-border-focus-outer [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 motion-safe:transition-[color,background-color,border-color,box-shadow] motion-safe:duration-200 rounded-full border-border-button-secondary-default bg-bg-button-secondary-default text-text-button-secondary-base-default [&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-default hover:border-border-button-secondary-hover hover:bg-bg-button-secondary-hover hover:text-text-button-secondary-base-hover hover:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-hover focus-visible:border-border-button-secondary-hover focus-visible:bg-bg-button-secondary-hover focus-visible:text-text-button-secondary-base-hover focus-visible:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-hover active:border-border-button-secondary-active active:bg-bg-button-secondary-active active:text-text-button-secondary-base-active active:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-active disabled:border-border-button-secondary-disabled disabled:bg-bg-button-secondary-disabled disabled:text-text-button-secondary-base-disabled disabled:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-disabled aria-disabled:border-border-button-secondary-disabled! aria-disabled:bg-bg-button-secondary-disabled! aria-disabled:text-text-button-secondary-base-disabled! aria-disabled:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-disabled! gap-2 h-auto min-h-10 min-w-0 px-3 py-2 text-center whitespace-normal wrap-break-word label-md-medium [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-icon-md w-full shrink-0 md:w-auto" aria-describedby="opens-in-new-tab-hint" href="https://apply.coveredca.com/static/lw-web/account-creation/choose-application"><span class="min-w-0">Apply Now</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div></div></li><li aria-hidden="true" class="mt-6 shrink-0 list-none border-t border-border-base-tertiary"></li><li class="pt-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:gap-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-md-regular text-text-base-primary wrap-break-word">Molina Is Leaving Some Regions</h3><p class="body-md-regular text-text-base-primary wrap-break-word">Molina Healthcare won&#x27;t offer plans in northeast Los Angeles County or Orange County in 2027. Use Shop and Compare to see what&#x27;s available and estimate your costs.</p></div><div class="w-full shrink-0 md:w-auto"><a data-slot="button" data-variant="secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="relative inline-flex items-center justify-center border-thin border-solid cursor-pointer disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-dashed focus-visible:outline-border-focus-outer [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 motion-safe:transition-[color,background-color,border-color,box-shadow] motion-safe:duration-200 rounded-full border-border-button-secondary-default bg-bg-button-secondary-default text-text-button-secondary-base-default [&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-default hover:border-border-button-secondary-hover hover:bg-bg-button-secondary-hover hover:text-text-button-secondary-base-hover hover:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-hover focus-visible:border-border-button-secondary-hover focus-visible:bg-bg-button-secondary-hover focus-visible:text-text-button-secondary-base-hover focus-visible:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-hover active:border-border-button-secondary-active active:bg-bg-button-secondary-active active:text-text-button-secondary-base-active active:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-active disabled:border-border-button-secondary-disabled disabled:bg-bg-button-secondary-disabled disabled:text-text-button-secondary-base-disabled disabled:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-disabled aria-disabled:border-border-button-secondary-disabled! aria-disabled:bg-bg-button-secondary-disabled! aria-disabled:text-text-button-secondary-base-disabled! aria-disabled:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-disabled! gap-2 h-auto min-h-10 min-w-0 px-3 py-2 text-center whitespace-normal wrap-break-word label-md-medium [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-icon-md w-full shrink-0 md:w-auto" aria-describedby="opens-in-new-tab-hint" href="https://apply.coveredca.com/lw-shopandcompare/"><span class="min-w-0">See Your Options</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div data-block-key="26ffd888b61d" class=""><section aria-labelledby="steps-section-6afbca8e-8285-4f73-af24-cf5881f7eb24" class="bg-bg-base-primary"><div class="container px-4 py-8 md:px-10 md:py-12 lg:p-16"><div class="max-w-steps-content-max mx-auto flex w-full flex-col gap-12"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-6 items-start text-left"><h2 id="steps-section-6afbca8e-8285-4f73-af24-cf5881f7eb24" class="display-xs-medium md:display-sm-medium text-text-base-primary wrap-break-word">How Enrollment Works</h2></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-12 lg:flex-row lg:items-stretch lg:gap-28"><ul class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 list-none flex-col" role="list"><li class="flex gap-2.5 pl-0 md:gap-8 md:pl-2"><div class="flex flex-col items-center self-stretch"><div aria-hidden="true" class="md:size-steps-badge-size flex size-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-border-base-secondary rounded-full border bg-bg-base-secondary md:p-5"><span class="heading-md-medium md:heading-xl-medium text-text-base-primary text-center">1</span></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="min-h-8 w-0 flex-1 border-border-base-quaternary border-l border-dashed"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4 pt-4 pb-8 md:pt-6"><h3 aria-label="Step 1 of 4: Apply" class="heading-sm-medium text-text-base-primary wrap-break-word">Apply</h3><div class="flex w-full flex-col [&amp;&gt;*+*]:mt-8 [&amp;&gt;h1+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h2+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h3+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h4+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h5+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h6+*]:mt-2.5"><p class="body-sm-regular md:body-md-regular text-text-steps-body break-words">One application covers both Covered California and Medi-Cal.</p></div></div></li><li class="flex gap-2.5 pl-0 md:gap-8 md:pl-2"><div class="flex flex-col items-center self-stretch"><div aria-hidden="true" class="md:size-steps-badge-size flex size-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-border-base-secondary rounded-full border bg-bg-base-secondary md:p-5"><span class="heading-md-medium md:heading-xl-medium text-text-base-primary text-center">2</span></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="min-h-8 w-0 flex-1 border-border-base-quaternary border-l border-dashed"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4 pt-4 pb-8 md:pt-6"><h3 aria-label="Step 2 of 4: Choose a Plan and Enroll" class="heading-sm-medium text-text-base-primary wrap-break-word">Choose a Plan and Enroll</h3><div class="flex w-full flex-col [&amp;&gt;*+*]:mt-8 [&amp;&gt;h1+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h2+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h3+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h4+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h5+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h6+*]:mt-2.5"><p class="body-sm-regular md:body-md-regular text-text-steps-body break-words">Compare your options and pick what fits your budget.</p></div></div></li><li class="flex gap-2.5 pl-0 md:gap-8 md:pl-2"><div class="flex flex-col items-center self-stretch"><div aria-hidden="true" class="md:size-steps-badge-size flex size-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-border-base-secondary rounded-full border bg-bg-base-secondary md:p-5"><span class="heading-md-medium md:heading-xl-medium text-text-base-primary text-center">3</span></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="min-h-8 w-0 flex-1 border-border-base-quaternary border-l border-dashed"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4 pt-4 pb-8 md:pt-6"><h3 aria-label="Step 3 of 4: Pay Your First Bill" class="heading-sm-medium text-text-base-primary wrap-break-word">Pay Your First Bill</h3><div class="flex w-full flex-col [&amp;&gt;*+*]:mt-8 [&amp;&gt;h1+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h2+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h3+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h4+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h5+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h6+*]:mt-2.5"><p class="body-sm-regular md:body-md-regular text-text-steps-body break-words">Pay online, or wait for a bill from your insurance company. This usually takes about two weeks.</p></div></div></li><li class="flex gap-2.5 pl-0 md:gap-8 md:pl-2"><div class="flex flex-col items-center self-stretch"><div aria-hidden="true" class="md:size-steps-badge-size flex size-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-border-base-secondary rounded-full border bg-bg-base-secondary md:p-5"><span class="heading-md-medium md:heading-xl-medium text-text-base-primary text-center">4</span></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4 pt-4 pb-0 md:pt-6"><h3 aria-label="Step 4 of 4: Get Your ID Card" class="heading-sm-medium text-text-base-primary wrap-break-word">Get Your ID Card</h3><div class="flex w-full flex-col [&amp;&gt;*+*]:mt-8 [&amp;&gt;h1+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h2+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h3+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h4+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h5+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h6+*]:mt-2.5"><p class="body-sm-regular md:body-md-regular text-text-steps-body break-words">Your insurance company mails your membership ID card once they receive your payment. You can use your plan before your ID arrives.</p></div></div></li></ul><div data-testid="steps-side-image" class="max-w-steps-image-width min-h-steps-image-min-height relative hidden w-full shrink-0 self-stretch overflow-hidden rounded-4xl lg:block"><img alt="An illustrated image of a person checking their to-do list and circling the first item on the list in red pen" class="absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="560px" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/gklaeeuu/production/8af076a9a995a10d338d895f4d4d00b3340835a4-560x700.svg?w=2400&amp;fit=max" style="object-position:50% 50%"/></div></div></div></div></section></div><div data-block-key="7a6babcc8ea6" class=""><section aria-labelledby="7b3c2ea1-33a0-4111-9e74-89205aa95237"><div class="container py-8 md:py-10 lg:py-12"><div class="themedark bg-bg-base-primary grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-7 rounded-4xl px-4 py-6 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-center md:rounded-3xl md:p-6 lg:rounded-4xl lg:px-16 lg:py-6"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-bg-base-alpha px-4 text-text-base-primary"><h2 id="7b3c2ea1-33a0-4111-9e74-89205aa95237" class="heading-md-medium wrap-break-word">Ready to see your options?</h2><p class="body-sm-regular wrap-break-word">Compare plans to find one that fits your needs and budget. Most people qualify for help paying for their plan.</p></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-stretch justify-center gap-3 md:w-auto md:flex-row md:flex-wrap md:items-center md:justify-end md:gap-3"><a data-slot="button" data-variant="secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-thin border-solid cursor-pointer disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 motion-safe:transition-[color,background-color,border-color,box-shadow] motion-safe:duration-200 rounded-full border-border-button-secondary-default bg-bg-button-secondary-default text-text-button-secondary-base-default [&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-default hover:border-border-button-secondary-hover hover:bg-bg-button-secondary-hover hover:text-text-button-secondary-base-hover hover:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-hover focus-visible:border-border-button-secondary-hover focus-visible:bg-bg-button-secondary-hover focus-visible:text-text-button-secondary-base-hover focus-visible:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-hover active:border-border-button-secondary-active active:bg-bg-button-secondary-active active:text-text-button-secondary-base-active active:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-active disabled:border-border-button-secondary-disabled disabled:bg-bg-button-secondary-disabled disabled:text-text-button-secondary-base-disabled disabled:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-disabled aria-disabled:border-border-button-secondary-disabled! aria-disabled:bg-bg-button-secondary-disabled! aria-disabled:text-text-button-secondary-base-disabled! aria-disabled:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-secondary-icon-disabled! gap-2 h-auto min-h-10 min-w-0 px-3 py-2 text-center whitespace-normal wrap-break-word label-md-medium [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-icon-md w-full md:w-auto focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-dashed focus-visible:outline-border-button-secondary-hover" aria-describedby="opens-in-new-tab-hint" href="https://apply.coveredca.com/lw-shopandcompare/"><span class="min-w-0">Shop and Compare</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a><a data-slot="button" data-variant="tertiary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-thin border-solid cursor-pointer disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 motion-safe:transition-[color,background-color,border-color,box-shadow] motion-safe:duration-200 rounded-full border-border-button-tertiary-default bg-bg-button-tertiary-default text-text-button-tertiary-base-default [&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-tertiary-icon-default hover:border-border-button-tertiary-hover hover:bg-bg-button-tertiary-hover hover:text-text-button-tertiary-base-hover hover:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-tertiary-icon-hover focus-visible:border-border-button-tertiary-hover focus-visible:bg-bg-button-tertiary-hover focus-visible:text-text-button-tertiary-base-hover focus-visible:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-tertiary-icon-hover active:border-border-button-tertiary-active active:bg-bg-button-tertiary-active active:text-text-button-tertiary-base-active active:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-tertiary-icon-active disabled:border-border-button-tertiary-disabled disabled:bg-bg-button-tertiary-disabled disabled:text-text-button-tertiary-base-disabled disabled:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-tertiary-icon-disabled aria-disabled:border-border-button-tertiary-disabled! aria-disabled:bg-bg-button-tertiary-disabled! aria-disabled:text-text-button-tertiary-base-disabled! aria-disabled:[&amp;_svg]:text-text-button-tertiary-icon-disabled! gap-2 h-auto min-h-10 min-w-0 px-3 py-2 text-center whitespace-normal wrap-break-word label-md-medium [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-icon-md w-full md:w-auto focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-dashed focus-visible:outline-border-button-secondary-hover" aria-describedby="opens-in-new-tab-hint" href="https://apply.coveredca.com/static/lw-web/account-creation/choose-application"><span class="min-w-0">Apply Now</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section></div><div data-block-key="3816b820c219" class=""><div class="container py-10 lg:py-12"><div class="page-grid max-w-full min-w-0"><div class="col-span-4 min-w-0 md:col-span-10 md:col-start-2 lg:col-span-8 lg:col-start-3"><div class="flex w-full flex-col [&amp;&gt;*+*]:mt-8 [&amp;&gt;h1+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h2+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h3+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h4+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h5+*]:mt-2.5 [&amp;&gt;h6+*]:mt-2.5"><h2 class="heading-lg-medium lg:display-sm-medium break-words text-text-base-primary [&amp;_strong]:font-[weight:inherit] [&amp;_b]:font-[weight:inherit]">Other Enrollment Options</h2><h3 class="heading-md-medium lg:heading-lg-medium text-text-base-primary break-words [&amp;_strong]:font-[weight:inherit] [&amp;_b]:font-[weight:inherit]">If Open Enrollment Is Over</h3><p class="body-sm-regular lg:body-md-regular text-text-base-primary break-words">Outside of open enrollment, you can enroll in health insurance if you experience a <a class="text-text-link-primary-base-default underline decoration-solid underline-offset-4 hover:text-text-link-primary-base-hover visited:text-text-link-primary-base-visited focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-dashed focus-visible:outline-border-focus-outer" href="/enrollment/major-life-changes">major life change</a>, like losing insurance or getting married. This is called a special enrollment period. This period usually lasts 60 days from the date of the event.</p><p class="body-sm-regular lg:body-md-regular text-text-base-primary break-words">Otherwise, you need to wait for the next open-enrollment period to enroll.</p><h3 class="heading-md-medium lg:heading-lg-medium text-text-base-primary break-words [&amp;_strong]:font-[weight:inherit] [&amp;_b]:font-[weight:inherit]">Medi-Cal Enrollment</h3><p class="body-sm-regular lg:body-md-regular text-text-base-primary break-words"><a class="text-text-link-primary-base-default underline decoration-solid underline-offset-4 hover:text-text-link-primary-base-hover visited:text-text-link-primary-base-visited focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-dashed focus-visible:outline-border-focus-outer" href="/coverage-basics/medi-cal">Medi-Cal</a> and Covered California share an application, so when you apply we’ll let you know which you are eligible for.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-block-key="1dc5dfcc4e67" class=""><div class="contents"><section aria-labelledby="cards-row-page-79baaa79-200a-4f75-b5e0-629068482567" class="bg-bg-base-primary rounded-t-4xl"><div class="container flex flex-col gap-4 px-4 py-8 md:gap-7 md:p-10 lg:gap-8 lg:px-16 lg:py-12"><div class="relative"><div class="flex w-full flex-col mx-auto lg:max-w-360 items-start text-left md:items-center md:text-center"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start text-left md:items-center md:text-center"><h2 id="cards-row-page-79baaa79-200a-4f75-b5e0-629068482567" class="display-xs-medium md:display-sm-medium font-display text-text-base-primary break-words">More Enrollment Help</h2></div></div></div><ul role="list" class="grid list-none grid-cols-1 gap-4 lg:gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3"><li class="flex min-w-0"><div class="group relative flex flex-col items-start justify-start overflow-clip border rounded-panel-asymmetric px-4 py-6 md:p-6 size-full max-w-none gap-7 bg-bg-base-secondary border-border-base-secondary motion-safe:transition-colors motion-safe:duration-200 hover:bg-bg-button-primary-hover hover:border-border-link-primary-default has-focus-visible:b